{"type":"text","timestamp":1790361721153,"sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","part":{"id":"prt_0d9dfd93a001Nv130fXjB36T1G","messageID":"msg_0d9df4fcc001qkTIN5b64589W1","sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","type":"text","text":"The rendered frame shows the minimap in the lower left with the player arrow centered and mob/crate icons visible at their relative locations. One synthetic input assertion still fails because Godot’s viewport event injection can route the final outside event differently than a real pointer; I’m isolating that assertion before finalizing and will remove the temporary checker afterward.","time":{"start":1790361721146,"end":1790361721148},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0a6f28b7b7b7527e016ab6c06fafdc8196b2ac5d7f86c7596e","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790361721165,"sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_ANvCznzySfpIiUFPtMDFFmzd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n@@\n \twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+\tprint(\"zoom after wheel up: \", minimap.zoom)\n \tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.6), \"Wheel up over the grid must reach minimap gui_input\")\n \twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN)\n+\tprint(\"zoom after wheel down: \", minimap.zoom)\n@@\n \twheel(root, Vector2(500, 500), MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+\tprint(\"zoom after outside: \", minimap.zoom)\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n@@ -65,17 +65,20 @@\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 5.0), \"Zoom must clamp at upper limit\")\n minimap.zoom = 1.5\n var inside = minimap.grid.get_global_rect().get_center()\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+print(\"zoom after wheel up: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.6), \"Wheel up over the grid must reach minimap gui_input\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN)\n+print(\"zoom after wheel down: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel down must reduce zoom\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP, false)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel releases must not change zoom\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT)\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Non-wheel clicks must not change zoom\")\n wheel(root, Vector2(500, 500), MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+print(\"zoom after outside: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Releases, non-wheel clicks and outside scrolling must not change zoom\")\n check(minimap.grid_scale.is_equal_approx(minimap.grid.size / minimap.get_viewport_rect().size * minimap.zoom), \"Zoom must update grid scale\")\n \n crate._on_body_entered(world)\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd","relativePath":"workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd","type":"update","patch":"Index: /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n@@ -65,17 +65,20 @@\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 5.0), \"Zoom must clamp at upper limit\")\n minimap.zoom = 1.5\n var inside = minimap.grid.get_global_rect().get_center()\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+print(\"zoom after wheel up: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.6), \"Wheel up over the grid must reach minimap gui_input\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN)\n+print(\"zoom after wheel down: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel down must reduce zoom\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP, false)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel releases must not change zoom\")\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT)\n wheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Non-wheel clicks must not change zoom\")\n wheel(root, Vector2(500, 500), MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n+print(\"zoom after outside: \", minimap.zoom)\n check(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Releases, non-wheel clicks and outside scrolling must not change zoom\")\n check(minimap.grid_scale.is_equal_approx(minimap.grid.size / minimap.get_viewport_rect().size * minimap.zoom), \"Zoom must update grid scale\")\n \n crate._on_body_entered(world)\n","additions":3,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd","time":{"start":1790361721151,"end":1790361721155}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0a6f28b7b7b7527e016ab6c073dec481969bc81bd72f1ce612"}},"id":"prt_0d9dfd93d001W3YQXPVOpgsQ3r","sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","messageID":"msg_0d9df4fcc001qkTIN5b64589W1"}}
