{"type":"text","timestamp":1790361887557,"sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","part":{"id":"prt_0d9e26339001kVa0IjR1o9qWkm","messageID":"msg_0d9e23c1f001EqymQbLZXGPXr4","sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","type":"text","text":"All integration checks now pass: eight markers, correct icons and rotation, edge clamping/shrinking, zoom limits and wheel input, and mob/crate marker removal. The input test needed matching wheel-release events to clear Godot’s mouse capture. I also inspected the rendered frame and confirmed the centered player arrow and visible object markers.","time":{"start":1790361887545,"end":1790361887547},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0a6f28b7b7b7527e016ab6c11e16288196a876782284f01ded","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790361887576,"sessionID":"ses_f2625f8f8ffeJ68r6chMPrFPv5","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_Fkr8ZOksJQN4GUIpcnNO43nU","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Delete File: /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nD workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/minimap_check.gd\n@@ -1,108 +0,0 @@\n-extends SceneTree\n-\n-var failures = 0\n-\n-func check(condition: bool, description: String):\n-\tif not condition:\n-\t\tfailures += 1\n-\t\tpush_error(description)\n-\n-func wheel(viewport: Viewport, position: Vector2, button: MouseButton, pressed: bool = true):\n-\tvar motion = InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n-\tmotion.position = position\n-\tmotion.global_position = position\n-\tviewport.push_input(motion, true)\n-\tvar event = InputEventMouseButton.new()\n-\tevent.position = position\n-\tevent.global_position = position\n-\tevent.button_index = button\n-\tevent.pressed = pressed\n-\tviewport.push_input(event, true)\n-\tif pressed and button in [MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN]:\n-\t\tvar release = event.duplicate()\n-\t\trelease.pressed = false\n-\t\tviewport.push_input(release, true)\n-\n-func _initialize():\n-\tcall_deferred(\"run\")\n-\n-func run():\n-\tvar world = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n-\troot.add_child(world)\n-\tvar minimap = world.get_node(\"CanvasLayer/Minimap\")\n-\tvar player = world.get_node(\"Player\")\n-\tplayer.set_physics_process(false)\n-\tvar objects = get_nodes_in_group(\"minimap_objects\")\n-\tfor object in objects:\n-\t\tobject.set_physics_process(false)\n-\tawait process_frame\n-\tawait process_frame\n-\tcheck(objects.size() == 8 and minimap.markers.size() == 8, \"Every mob and crate must have a marker\")\n-\tcheck(minimap.player_marker.position.is_equal_approx(minimap.grid.size / 2), \"Player marker must be centered after layout\")\n-\tcheck(not minimap.mob_marker.visible and not minimap.alert_marker.visible, \"Prototypes must remain hidden\")\n-\tfor object in objects:\n-\t\tcheck(object.removed.is_connected(minimap._on_object_removed), \"World must connect every removed signal\")\n-\t\tvar marker = minimap.markers[object]\n-\t\tcheck(marker.visible and marker.texture == minimap.icons[object.minimap_icon].texture, \"Marker must use its object's icon\")\n-\t\tcheck(marker.get_parent() == minimap.grid, \"Markers must be grid children\")\n-\n-\tvar crate = world.get_node(\"Crates/Crate\")\n-\tvar marker = minimap.markers[crate]\n-\tworld.get_node(\"Crates\").position = Vector2(50, 70)\n-\tcrate.global_position = player.global_position + Vector2(100, 100)\n-\tplayer.rotation = 0.7\n-\tminimap._process(0.0)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.player_marker.rotation, 0.7 + PI / 2), \"Arrow must track player rotation\")\n-\tcheck(marker.position.is_equal_approx(minimap.player_marker.position + Vector2(100, 100) * minimap.grid_scale), \"Marker must use global player-relative position\")\n-\tcheck(marker.scale == Vector2.ONE, \"In-grid markers must have full scale\")\n-\tcrate.global_position = player.global_position + Vector2(100000, -100000)\n-\tminimap._process(0.0)\n-\tcheck(marker.position.is_equal_approx(Vector2(minimap.grid.size.x, 0)), \"Off-grid markers must clamp to the grid\")\n-\tcheck(marker.scale == Vector2(0.75, 0.75), \"Off-grid markers must shrink to 0.75\")\n-\tcrate.global_position = player.global_position\n-\tminimap._process(0.0)\n-\tcheck(marker.position.is_equal_approx(minimap.player_marker.position) and marker.scale == Vector2.ONE, \"Returning marker must regain full scale\")\n-\n-\tminimap.zoom = -100\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 0.5), \"Zoom must clamp at lower limit\")\n-\tminimap.zoom = 100\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 5.0), \"Zoom must clamp at upper limit\")\n-\tminimap.zoom = 1.5\n-\tvar inside = minimap.grid.get_global_rect().get_center()\n-\tminimap.gui_input.connect(func(event):\n-\t\tif event is InputEventMouseButton:\n-\t\t\tprint(\"gui button \", event.button_index, \" pressed \", event.pressed, \" at \", event.position)\n-\t)\n-\tprint(\"minimap rect \", minimap.get_global_rect(), \" viewport \", root.get_visible_rect())\n-\twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n-\tprint(\"zoom after wheel up: \", minimap.zoom)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.6), \"Wheel up over the grid must reach minimap gui_input\")\n-\twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_DOWN)\n-\tprint(\"zoom after wheel down: \", minimap.zoom)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel down must reduce zoom\")\n-\twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP, false)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Wheel releases must not change zoom\")\n-\twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT)\n-\twheel(root, inside, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Non-wheel clicks must not change zoom\")\n-\twheel(root, Vector2(500, 500), MOUSE_BUTTON_WHEEL_UP)\n-\tprint(\"zoom after outside: \", minimap.zoom)\n-\tcheck(is_equal_approx(minimap.zoom, 1.5), \"Releases, non-wheel clicks and outside scrolling must not change zoom\")\n-\tcheck(minimap.grid_scale.is_equal_approx(minimap.grid.size / minimap.get_viewport_rect().size * minimap.zoom), \"Zoom must update grid scale\")\n-\n-\tcrate._on_body_entered(world)\n-\tcheck(minimap.markers.has(crate), \"Non-player collision must not remove crate\")\n-\tcrate._on_body_entered(player)\n-\tcheck(not minimap.markers.has(crate) and marker.is_queued_for_deletion(), \"Crate removal must erase and free its marker\")\n-\tminimap._on_object_removed(crate)\n-\tvar mob = world.get_node(\"Mobs/Mob\")\n-\tvar mob_marker = minimap.markers[mob]\n-\tmob.queue_free()\n-\tawait process_frame\n-\tawait process_frame\n-\tc